{"id":502,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"1885年創立の女子教育を継ぐ学院","feature_description":"福岡女学院中学校・高等学校は、1885年から一世紀以上にわたって女子教育を積み重ねてきた学校です。キリスト教精神を土台に、学校生活の中で部活動や生徒活動を大切にし、新入生向けの見学ツアーも行っています。クラブ活動は運動部、文化部、同好会まで幅広く、学びと交わりを通して学校文化を育てています。学びの幅と学校生活の厚みを感じやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":9928,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www0.fukujo.ac.jp/js/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9929,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www0.fukujo.ac.jp/js/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9930,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www0.fukujo.ac.jp/js/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9931,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www0.fukujo.ac.jp/js/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9932,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www0.fukujo.ac.jp/js/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9933,"name":"バトン・カラーガード部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www0.fukujo.ac.jp/js/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9934,"name":"音楽部【ミュージカル】","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www0.fukujo.ac.jp/js/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9935,"name":"ハンドベルクワイア","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www0.fukujo.ac.jp/js/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9936,"name":"YWCA部【ボランティア活動】","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www0.fukujo.ac.jp/js/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9937,"name":"Missionクワイア【聖歌隊】","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www0.fukujo.ac.jp/js/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9938,"name":"Missionオーケストラ部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www0.fukujo.ac.jp/js/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9939,"name":"ESS部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www0.fukujo.ac.jp/js/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9940,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","sour